IR --> CR : uses
IR --> SI : reads
IR --> SU : instantiates
ST --> VT : uses templates
TC --> TG : produces graph

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' IOR-based parent/children links (scenario JSON)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

note bottom of TO
  **IOR Forward Links (scenario JSON)**
  model.tasks[] = ["ior:instance:<uuid>", ...]
  model.useCases[] = ["ior:instance:<uuid>", ...]
  model.classes[] = ["ior:instance:<uuid>", ...]
  model.methods[] = ["ior:instance:<uuid>", ...]
  model.implementations[] = ["ior:instance:<uuid>", ...]
  model.tests[] = ["ior:instance:<uuid>", ...]

  **parent/children (T175 Tree getter)**
  get parent → walk ABOVE map + FORWARD scan
  get children → FORWARD_KEYS[this.type] → resolve()
end note

legend bottom right
  **LOCKED 7-step chain** (T168)
  req → task → uc → class → method → impl → test
  Forward-only. No backward links in display (T181).
  Every [class:uuid] / [method:uuid] feeds the
  UC→Class→Method chain for T178 44/44.
endlegend

